excerpt:

After nearly a decade in [Jazzband], [pip-tools] has moved under the
[PyPA]. v7.7.0 is our first release from the new home, so here's how it
went: a mailing-list vote, a lot of waiting, and a GitHub transfer that
left a few Jazzband ghosts behind.

[Jazzband]: https://jazzband.co
[pip-tools]: https://pip-tools.pypa.io
[PyPA]: https://www.pypa.io
